<title>SOUTH AFRICA: De Beers meets with Zairean rebels. [CORRECTED 11:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>De Beers meets with Zairean rebels. [CORRECTED 11:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African diamond giant De Beers Consolidated Mines Ltd said on Monday it had met with Zairean rebel leader Laurent Kabila at the weekend (corrects to make clear that they had met with Laurent Kabila, and not just representatives of him).</p>
</text>
